NV_PK(33,{"the full front of dacheng gate five bays of red doors covered with rows of gold studs carved stone windows and painted wall panels on both sides and roof ridges that curl up like a swallow's tail a tall sign at the right doorway carries a saying from confucius about helping others do good": "", "the lawn in front of minglun hall and the gate of entering virtue three plaques hang on the white wall gate of entering virtue in the middle with gate of the worthy and realm of the sage on either side a huge old tree stands in front and a stone stele on the right": "", "the temple seen across the lawn the little gate of rites is on the left a stone stele stands in front and the big tree and the gate of entering virtue are in the middle behind them rise the curved ridges of dacheng hall the whole temple hides among green trees and red walls": ""})